WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.600
HIPAA training. Module 1. HIPAA foundations and your role at ERS.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.233
HIPAA exists so people can trust that their health information

3
00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:15.333
is used for their care, and for nothing else.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.433
The Privacy Rule: who may use or share information, and why.

5
00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:25.800
The Security Rule: how electronic information is kept safe.

6
00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:30.433
The Breach Notification Rule: what happens when it is exposed.

7
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.100
The clinic holds the information.

8
00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:38.267
ERS is bound by an agreement.

9
00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:42.967
Anyone ERS uses makes the same promise.

10
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:45.433
And you are the last link.

11
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:50.233
Education: everyone knows the rules and why.

12
00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:54.900
Commitment: everyone does their part, even when nobody is watching.

13
00:00:55.233 --> 00:00:58.633
Culture: asking and reporting feel normal.

14
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.833
Open a record only to complete the task you were given.

15
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:10.367
Looking up a neighbor or friend is not allowed, even if the system lets you in.

16
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.733
Nor is copying records to your phone.

17
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:15.467
Stop.

18
00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:16.867
Do not share.

19
00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:18.400
Ask your lead.

20
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.533
Now read the module.
